Fix build failure with openssl-4
https://bugs.gentoo.org/985564
Patch from upstream, backported to 14.9.25

commit 74761c6283f6fbd0f03e5e385323ee65c0ed0a9f
Author: Steffen Nurpmeso <steffen@sdaoden.eu>
Date:   Sat, 30 May 2026 23:42:00 +0200

